      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation, using the following words.</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/exams/set_2_-_Planet_Earth_5745ff84.png\" alt width=\"500\"></p>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"97\">Liam: Today in class, we learned about the importance of <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.1</label><input id='fbo-907856-0' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='0' name='fbo-907856-0' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907856-0' /></span></strong>&nbsp;on Earth.</p>\n<p data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"202\">Jane: I know. It is important for animals, plants, and <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.2</label><input id='fbo-907856-1' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='1' name='fbo-907856-1' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907856-1' /></span></strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"290\">Liam: Yes! However, many people do not have enough clean water to drink or use every day.</p>\n<p data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"389\">Jane: That is sad. I read that <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.3</label><input id='fbo-907856-2' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='2' name='fbo-907856-2' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907856-2' /></span></strong>&nbsp;from factories and trash can make water dirty.</p>\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"491\">Liam: That&#8217;s true! Farmers also use<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.4</label><input id='fbo-907856-3' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='3' name='fbo-907856-3' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-907856-3' /></span></strong>&nbsp;on crops, and sometimes it goes into rivers.</p>\n<p data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"563\">Jane: We should protect water by keeping rivers and lakes clean.</p>\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"633\">Liam: I agree! Everyone needs to help take care of our planet.</p>",
