      "questionName": "role, habitat, save, affect",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"241\"><strong>Read the following passage and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"50\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"50\">Protecting Our Planet: A Shared Responsibility</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"141\">Earth is home to many plants, animals, and people. <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-907928-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-907928-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-907928-0'></option><option value=\"Harvests\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-0-Harvests'>Harvests</option><option value=\"Habits\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-0-Habits'>Habits</option><option value=\"Livestock\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-0-Livestock'>Livestock</option><option value=\"Habitats\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-0-Habitats'>Habitats</option></select></span></strong> are important because they provide food, water, and shelter for living things.</p>\n<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"141\">Humans have an important <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-907928-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-907928-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-907928-1'></option><option value=\"goal\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-1-goal'>goal</option><option value=\"role\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-1-role'>role</option><option value=\"challenge\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-1-challenge'>challenge</option><option value=\"task\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-1-task'>task</option></select></span></strong> in protecting nature. Here&#8217;s how we can help protect nature:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"860\">\n<li data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"422\">Plant trees to help restore ecosystems</li>\n<li data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"469\">Clean up rivers to keep water sources safe</li>\n<li data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"505\">Reduce waste to limit pollution</li>\n<li data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"752\">Protect endangered animals' natural spaces to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-907928-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-907928-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-907928-2'></option><option value=\"save\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-2-save'>save</option><option value=\"kill\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-2-kill'>kill</option><option value=\"hunt\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-2-hunt'>hunt</option><option value=\"charge\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-2-charge'>charge</option></select></span></strong> them from extinction</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If we don&#8217;t act, pollution and deforestation will <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-907928-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-907928-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-907928-3'></option><option value=\"protect\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-3-protect'>protect</option><option value=\"release\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-3-release'>release</option><option value=\"stretch\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-3-stretch'>stretch</option><option value=\"affect\" data-testid='fillblank-option-907928-3-affect'>affect</option></select></span> </strong>wildlife, making it harder for animals to find food and shelter.</p>\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"964\">Small actions lead to big changes. Together, we can keep Earth beautiful for future generations. Let&#8217;s protect our planet today!</p>",
